## Series admission

admitted: no
decided from evidence upstream of the measured latency; the contamination verdict below is recorded and does not decide this.

| evidence | observed | disposition |
|----------|----------|-------------|
| precondition-waiver | not given | clean |
| fixture-use | excluded_from_series forced true: this run was driven by fixture data (NRMEASURE_FACTS_FIXTURE, NRMEASURE_INTERRUPTS_FIXTURE) rather than the real machine; a fixture text is read repeatedly for every interference snapshot, so every delta it produces is exactly zero, which must never be read as evidence of a quiet machine | excluding |
| tool-exit-codes | cyclictest=0 | clean |
| preconditions | 15 pass, 0 fail, 0 not-applicable, 0 unavailable | clean |
| interference-counters | cal max 0 on cpu11, tlb max 0 on cpu11, res max 0 on cpu11, irq max 0 on cpu11, over 0s | not-thresholded |
| smi-delta | reading MSR_SMI_COUNT requires Linux; set NRMEASURE_SMI_FIXTURE to run against a fixture on this host | unavailable |
| thermal-maximum | 40.0 C | not-thresholded |

exclusions:
