## Contamination verdict

verdict: contaminated
reason: excluded_from_series forced true: this run was driven by fixture data (NRMEASURE_FACTS_FIXTURE, NRMEASURE_INTERRUPTS_FIXTURE) rather than the real machine; a fixture text is read repeatedly for every interference snapshot, so every delta it produces is exactly zero, which must never be read as evidence of a quiet machine
this verdict is an inference from the shape of this run's own measured latency; it does not by itself remove the run from the series (see Series admission above).
thresholds: provisional (derived from 2 runs, not a calibrated set; see config/contamination-thresholds.json)

